<description>&lt;p&gt;South Sudan has again delayed its first post-independence elections, now set for February 2027, as violence escalates in the north-east where opposition forces clash with government troops in Akobo. Amnesty International and the United Nations have been criticised for ignoring warnings before the Abiemnom massacre that killed at least 213 civilians. An ambush on a convoy in Juba killed two people, including a journalist, and a CityLink Aviation plane crashed near Juba, killing all 14 aboard. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPeThJckdvVVVXeHlmS2Vpem5sZFVHRUF2QmdsT3dNRjN2Sy10SVZPeTM1cTJTYVFXd3YzTnprVXZaN0o3SkljdWJDQUZHOUMtY2NFMVhSWi03WFJwLUhwbFl4bEFTTldybkl4ZWg0QzVUM2NQRGtwa2hlTEdYcGRqbWpwaWJpWS1zME05MWo3TTlFN29tdExFcnVjY0tPalZHTzFfa0ZvdjVQejEyM3BTS0JpajlfQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPVFoxQmpwenQtQ2xaV1hlMmh1RTNUZHFwWUxMZ3d0aUpQTUgxc2FVVmZDTlBOaUF5cjAwbVRDM2ExTXEzd0poVjluRHFLdTl2ZlNLQ1RUTlM3SmgtWTB6TlV0LUlhM3V4RV8weEhSZVA3M3I3SzRZOHNIMEdlQ0hNV3hrWHVPMGxNNG5V?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPcTg5QmtiZEZleDJkQU5KVUNERDV1ZXdQMkgwQktVcjlOT3BITE56TUstVkVUNGR3T01zTFd6dVFmRjRXblRsd2dtei1JYkc0amp3cVhtZkdQaDQ4dGFLNGNCX2MxQ2VJMmZiTy10OXhTeG9ad2dzdFBSYWhWUGlPY1I5d0pJdWcwSEkyREtiWk5MR3Q3QlJGSGMxcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Top Sports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOYVVoQVVBckRKQVV0MzFqWE5rVW11Mzg3UGI0anBLLWFpWURZV19NZVF